face":"監止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002744","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m013-0220","start":220,"end":222,"surface":"監止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002744","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m016-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"監止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002744","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji046-010","person_id":"cbr-p002744","title":"左右相","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p012","quote":"鮑牧與齊悼公有郄，弒悼公。齊人共立其子壬，是爲簡公。田常成子與監止倶爲左右相，相簡公。田常心害監止，監止幸於簡公，權弗能去。於是田常復修釐子之政，以大斗出貸，以小斗收。齊人歌之曰：「嫗乎采芑，歸乎田成子！」齊大夫朝，御鞅諫簡公曰：「田、監不可并也，君其擇焉。」君弗聽。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji046-010:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p012","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"左右相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0031","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、任事與文獻用稱分存；欲使為卿且辭未當已任，諡稱不當生前任職，死亡或首次用稱不補任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji046-038","person_id":"cbr-p002744","surfaces":["監止"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p012","quote":"鮑牧與齊悼公有郄，弒悼公。齊人共立其子壬，是爲簡公。田常成子與監止倶爲左右相，相簡公。田常心害監止，監止幸於簡公，權弗能去。於是田常復修釐子之政，以大斗出貸，以小斗收。齊人歌之曰：「嫗乎采芑，歸乎田成子！」齊大夫朝，御鞅諫簡公曰：「田、監不可并也，君其擇焉。」君弗聽。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p013","quote":"子我者，監止之宗人也，常與田氏有卻。田氏疎族田豹事子我有寵。子我曰：「吾欲盡滅田氏適，以豹代田氏宗。」豹曰：「臣於田氏疎矣。」不聽。已而豹謂田氏曰：「子我將誅田氏，田氏弗先，禍及矣。」子我舍公宮，田常兄弟四人乘如公宮，欲殺子我。子我閉門。簡公與婦人飲檀臺，將欲撃田常。太史子餘曰：「田常非敢爲亂，將除害。」簡公乃止。田常出，聞簡公怒，恐誅，將出亡。田子行曰：「需，事之賊也。」田常於是撃子我。子我率其徒攻田氏，不勝，出亡。田氏之徒追殺子我及監止。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p016","quote":"田常言於齊平公曰：「德施人之所欲，君其行之；刑罰人之所惡，臣請行之。」行之五年，齊國之政皆歸田常。田常於是盡誅鮑、晏、監止及公族之彊者，而割齊自安平以東至瑯邪，自爲封邑。封邑大於平公之所食。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為、繼位及局部事件暫接；姜齊與田齊桓公、不同時段未名王及同字忌分開。孫子不先補孫臏，子守髙唐不補闕字，索隱短稱與代詞仍待核；未跨篇按同名接人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p012","text":"鮑牧與齊悼公有郄，弒悼公。齊人共立其子壬，是爲簡公。田常成子與監止倶爲左右相，相簡公。田常心害監止，監止幸於簡公，權弗能去。於是田常復修釐子之政，以大斗出貸，以小斗收。齊人歌之曰：「嫗乎采芑，歸乎田成子！」齊大夫朝，御鞅諫簡公曰：「田、監不可并也，君其擇焉。」君弗聽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鮑牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002742","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"齊悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002725","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002725","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"壬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0026","start":26,"end":30,"surface":"田常成子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002726","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"監止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002744","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002743","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0043","start":43,"end":45,"s